---
layout: base.njk
title: Software
description: Open source software by Noah Prail, from developer tools to Capacitor plugins and Raspberry Pi projects.
---
<section class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-24">
  <div class="mb-14">
    <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-neutral-500 mb-3">Work</p>
    <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold tracking-tighter mb-6">Software</h1>
    <p class="text-neutral-400">Open source projects I build and maintain, from developer tools and plugins to small apps I made for myself.</p>
  </div>

  <h2 class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-neutral-500 mb-5">Featured</h2>
  <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-5 mb-16">
    {% for project in software %}{% if project.featured %}
    <article class="group flex flex-col rounded-xl bg-neutral-900 border border-neutral-800/60 p-6 hover:border-neutral-600 transition-colors">
      <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-500 mb-3">{{ project.language }}</p>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight mb-2">{{ project.name }}</h3>
      <p class="text-sm text-neutral-400 mb-6">{{ project.description }}</p>
      <div class="mt-auto flex items-center gap-5 text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-400">
        <a href="{{ project.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-neutral-100 transition-colors">GitHub &rarr;</a>
        {% if project.homepage %}<a href="{{ project.homepage }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-neutral-100 transition-colors">Docs &rarr;</a>{% endif %}
      </div>
    </article>
    {% endif %}{% endfor %}
  </div>

  <h2 class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-neutral-500 mb-5">More projects</h2>
  <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-x-8">
    {% for project in software %}{% if not project.featured %}
    <a href="{{ project.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="group block py-5 border-t border-neutral-800/60">
      <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 mb-1">
        <h3 class="text-base font-semibold tracking-tight group-hover:text-neutral-300 transition-colors">{{ project.name }}{% if project.experimental %} <span class="ml-2 align-middle rounded-full border border-neutral-700 px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-400">Experimental</span>{% endif %}</h3>
        <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-500">{{ project.language }}</span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm text-neutral-400">{{ project.description }}</p>
    </a>
    {% endif %}{% endfor %}
  </div>

  <p class="mt-12 text-sm text-neutral-500">More on <a href="{{ social.github }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-neutral-300 hover:text-neutral-100 underline underline-offset-4">GitHub</a>.</p>
</section>
